t;于千惠为彭博社绘制的插图&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;h3 style="font-size: 24px; line-height: 30px; font-weight: 700; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid; margin-top: 40px;"&gt;对话开始者&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;有时文化会走上坡路。&lt;/strong&gt;克里斯托弗·诺兰的&lt;em style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;《奥德赛》&lt;/em&gt;不仅让电影院座无虚席，它还让读者重温荷马史诗，并重新引发关于为什么经典在人工智能时代仍然重要的争论。一部轰动一时的课程也许能完成&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/3tGqOzjArEqjDi8_TH5zosP7U3tC66sIlQKpXHkRJbGMki4YOIiqEiF0XtIbqnYcOosBQ0mTOK50IwNd62MDxUP3ayG-6zUwbIs06cE6KfzfD4o8bd3Z_MZ1yubOEFilo6NhC4ZsotIQtIGnQJ6gVFlwC7g9Kqv82GYgZGgBS5xTXerIbYcMgs1yhWtEdf7MQGRCmcQHJ3dAdtjrIQxkLd2AEPaVI-KkqeAuy0rrMbrZ6-yhYJumLmDGt1w73uMeld69fo4V2WFAgjm_ipXlAnBdI822Rnea0KMIPqobyMGUF7Z_ZKppe_jQoWVSoL_wvIN8bFo8nrqPor-hmRPkTVqMS_UIuXjiXsbIbZdTXWPfJTCBR0DKeDiTEul6kYD1XZJSwVoT0eOYwOuuivpnXq5ueVXhnD438eyzrrpzPgnpYz0M6hwUvFCAkcNiICS0071tNF_UuVmZLHWpBw7C6tINn7N-QTwZzAQcgkLQ2698wtEe9sQti9_YRGD1yBotTimIpIoW8K98mmLJFDutgz1eN8G5nAQMabmaew/r5KUawJvEPUHfhNkzw9yHQ5Qv0w4UNkm/23" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="诺兰《奥德赛》让荷马和经典再次火爆"&gt;多年的课程争夺所无法&lt;/a&gt;实现的目标。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;有时没有好的选择，只有更好的坏选择。&lt;/strong&gt;随着油价飙升和全球航运面临新的瓶颈，美国面临着与在锡拉和卡律布狄斯之间航行的奥德修斯同样的困境： &lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/fqBMET-j1S9wo3Ec2S7c9exw3peMqpYoQgxL0PXftWKRVLTcBTh3YsORp4i6ptiysNTHppotspHRE-GvoRjCS9DhtTheWOu-uD6Q01LNADD2EvK4RRHGs64l643DaZj7PRf5OWvHmmJUUIEFiCZU6GrHnxH2ZU9fpRgE7_daqhQKNlWYU2PyBbfBxT6hTORXCkjKezXWyk3lP5yDhpNs4PV61el1QEcLjm8M8wo2scIA2WaW6nBhigELImPb76jN-GDAUBS2G6Etkt3a59OZADvOYSWjfRJKRdPPz7L-Mj4H1uJFB8jEHhYGzoRsMk0P1_CHoM64xOS8jsSOS0PJgCvA66vmHVHzyNFXS991efs7mhyeXPLSQvk6zUux7ao6Ltxv25wiLizLkhRGZcIBUmCDy_kI6-FX3Yu081XBk1gVES8T2VT6aMjFErtWMj1Plwlx-b3mulX7qvLfe9k_N5vnG_tBa3u4ai7QOxv-0JOmy-3YzEwx9RKGo50r5_W3erUR9k8fm3PlAz